<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.spirit.burns ~ otakiage ~ write the ash lines ahead, then burn

`lares spirit otakiage <pet>` runs on a person's hand alone. It lists the spirit's residue and carries, holds what the last distill mark leaves uncovered, a carry a standing carry names as parent, and anything a link or a mention still reaches, writes the ash lines for the rest to the month's ledger first, then burns them. The card stays. A re-run completes a burn that stopped halfway.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ burn

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`burn` params=`pet/lares-alpha ~ burn what the distill mark covers`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · pet

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pet` params=`takes/pet-name needs/required seat/1 as/<pet> ~ the spirit's pet name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ the door reads the process chain; a seat's run refuses`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ spirit-pet-malformed · hand-act-only · hand-unattested · spirit-ashes-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-pet-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.burns pet/lares-alpha]] ~ the word reads as no pet name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ an AI seat ran a hand's act; a person runs the line`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-unattested` params=`~ nothing attests the branch as a hand`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-ashes-refused` params=`~ the ash ledger refused the append; nothing burned`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

